<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>Hydraulic pressure generated by the pump in the brake actuator is directed to the wheel cylinders of each wheel, suppressing wheel slip caused by the driving force.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
